  "description": "Specially designed for girls and women\n\nThe ergonomic design with a low step-through and adapted frame geometry ensures greater comfort and control while riding.\n\nRobust steel frame\n\nMade of high-strength carbon steel, the bike offers high stability and durability – ideal for everyday use or weekend rides.\n\n18-speed gears for flexible riding\n\nThe easy-to-use 18-speed derailleur gears help you adapt efficiently to different terrain and gradient conditions.\n\nReliable dual V-brakes\n\nThe front and rear V-brakes ensure strong braking performance and increase safety on every ride.\n\nAvailable in 24 and 26-inch sizes\n\nThe 24-inch bike is perfect for riders between 145 cm and 160 cm, while the 26-inch bike is suitable for riders between 158 cm and 175 cm. Ideal as an entry-level MTB for teenagers or adults.\n\nExperience the trail with the Hiland Lavender 2 Women's Mountain Bike. Features a lightweight aluminum frame, 21-speed drivetrain, and dual disc brakes for smooth, safe off-road adventures.",
